  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;">TERMS & CONDITIONS</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>All rates are quoted in Indonesian Rupiah (IDR), based on per room per night, valid for single or double occupancy per room.</li>
    <li>Published rates are subject to 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge.</li>
    <li>Contract rates quoted are non-commissionable, inclusive of 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge, applicable strictly for the sole use of the Company.</li>
    <li>All reservations are subject to room's availability at the time of reservation or as per allotment agreement.</li>
    <li>Contract rates are applicable on your Company's account against the authorized Travel Agent Voucher.</li>
    <li>Should there be an extension of stay on guest's personal account, the best available rates shall apply subject to availability to protect the confidentiality of this agreement.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Extra Bed Policy</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Extra bed is available for all room categories at IDR {{ extra_bed_rate }} net per night. Rate is inclusive of 11% prevailing government tax & 10% service charge. Limited to a maximum of one extra bed per room.</li>
    <li>Baby cots are available to be provided at no cost to a maximum of one cot per room.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Children Policy</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Accommodation is free of charge for children up to 11.99 years of age sharing the same room with parents and using existing bedding or using a complimentary baby cot.</li>
    <li>Complimentary all meals at available restaurant for children up to 3 years old when accompanying an adult who is having a full paying meal.</li>
    <li>50% discount on all contracted meal will apply for children from 3 to 11.99 years old when accompanying an adult who is having a full paying meal.</li>
  </ul>

