  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Reservation Procedures</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>All reservations have to be submitted within 48 hours upon receipt and are subject to availability or allotment agreement.</li>
    <li>Reservations shall not be binding until written acceptance and confirmation has been received from the Hotel.</li>
    <li>In order for us to provide personalized service and ensuring the implementation of personal preference services to all our guests, information on guest profile including phone number and email address is required to be submitted to the Hotel for all bookings made.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Check In and Check Out</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Check in time is 14:00 hours. Check Out time is 12:00 hours.</li>
    <li>Guaranteed late check out can only be confirmed prior to arrival by the payment of one (1) night charge at the contracted rate.</li>
    <li>Late Check Out to 18:00 hours will incur additional charge of 50% based on contracted rate. Check out after 18:00 hours will incur additional one (1) night charge. And subject to availability.</li>
  </ul>

