  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">No Show</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Early departure will subject to a penalty equal to "a full charge on whole period of stay".</li>
    <li>Group reservation cancellation policy applies dependent on seasonality and specific terms & conditions upon confirmation of group booking.</li>
    <li>A reservation is considered "No Show" if arrival does not occur on the date reserved and Hotel is not notified of any emergency delays in writing. No show will subject to a penalty equal to "a full charge on whole period of stay".</li>
    <li>No Show must be paid without reliance on billed vouchers since as the guests did not arrived in the Hotel, no voucher will be submitted.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Billing Procedures</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 12px;">Pursuant to Bank Indonesia regulation effective 1 July 2015, all payments shall be made in Rupiah currency and therefore all of our quoted US Dollar amount shall be automatically converted into Rupiah amount using our dynamic bookkeeping rate on the day payment is made.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Payment</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Reservations will only be accepted with full pre-payment for non-credited companies unless credit facilities established with Hotel's Financial Controller.</li>
    <li>For Company with approved credit facilities, the Hotel will send a statement of account, and settled by the Company in full, without producing consent from guests, received within thirty (30) days after tender of invoice.</li>
    <li>The Hotel reserves the right to withdraw credit facilities provided, subject to Company's prevailing credit standing with the Hotel, without prejudice to the rest of terms herein.</li>
    <li>Corporate credit cards are accepted for deposit payment or settlement of account.</li>
  </ul>

